[h1]Languages (语言)[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/voxygen/README/README.html]EN/English[/url] | [url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/voxygen/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Voxygen[/h1]A client-side Fabric mod that generates missing vanilla chunks into Voxy using per-server seeds and client-side commands.
[h2]Commands[/h2][code]/voxygen on
/voxygen off
/voxygen status
/voxygen toggle
/voxygen radius
/voxygen radius <radius>
/voxygen threads
/voxygen threads <threads>
/voxygen progress
/voxygen progress on|off|toggle
/voxygen seed
/voxygen seed <seed>[/code]
[list]
[*][b]on[/b] and [b]off[/b] enable or disable Voxygen globally.[/*]
[*][b]status[/b] shows the current state and the seed recorded for the current world.[/*]
[*][b]toggle[/b] switches the current state.[/*]
[*][b]radius[/b] shows the configured radius in chunks.[/*]
[*][b]radius <radius>[/b] sets the radius to a positive integer. The default is [b]64[/b] chunks.[/*]
[*][b]threads[/b] shows the configured worker count.[/*]
[*][b]threads <threads>[/b] sets the worker count from [b]1[/b] to [b]256[/b]. The default is [b]32[/b].[/*]
[*][b]progress[/b] shows whether the generation progress boss bar is enabled.[/*]
[*][b]progress on|off|toggle[/b] controls the yellow [b]Voxygen[/b] progress boss bar. It is disabled by default and disappears two seconds after generation completes.[/*]
[*][b]seed[/b] shows the seed recorded for the current world.[/*]
[*][b]seed <seed>[/b] manually sets the seed when no local integrated-server seed is available. The argument is hidden when the local seed can be read directly.[/*]
[/list]In singleplayer, Voxygen reads the real seed directly from Minecraft's integrated server and uses it without saving it to the configuration. Otherwise, the seed is configured explicitly with [b]/voxygen seed <seed>[/b].
[h2]Supported Versions[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 26.3[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.19.5+[/*]
[*]Fabric API 0.160.5+[/*]
[*]Java 25[/*]
[*]Voxy (Required)[/*]
[/list][h2]License[/h2]MIT
